# Browser
# Wild Ride is in Bot1's graveyard and its pile's note says it can be cast and for what (Harmonize {4}{R}), and a click on it casts it (a card with one thing to do has no menu).
# Casting it asks for the creature to tap as part of the cost, before anything is paid: the dock says it is up to one, that the
# creature's power comes off the generic mana, and with none chosen that the full cost is paid; choosing Ragavan (power 2) the button
# says "Tap it (-2)" and the cost comes down to {2}{R}: the payment asks for that total, and the Mountain, Mox Pearl and Mox Jet
# tapped while paying pay it (CR 702.180a), leaving Mox Ruby untapped. The card is exiled after it resolves.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Ragavan, Nimble Pilferer
Wild Ride
Ornithopter
Mountain x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ragavan, Nimble Pilferer.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Wild Ride.Cast(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Client.Bot1.Graveyard.Note = A card here can be cast (Wild Ride: Harmonize {4}{R}). Click to look.
Bot1.Graveyard.Wild Ride.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter; Ability: Harmonize)
? Client.Bot1.Prompt.Title = Wild Ride: tap up to one untapped creature you control to reduce the cost by generic mana equal to its power
? Client.Bot1.Prompt.Detail = None tapped: the full cost is paid  ·  click them on the battlefield
Bot1.Choose(Ragavan, Nimble Pilferer)
? Client.Bot1.Confirm = Tap it (-2)
? Client.Bot1.Prompt.Title = Pay for Wild Ride
? Client.Bot1.Prompt.Detail = {2}{R} of {2}{R} still to pay  ·  tap a land
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Exile = Wild Ride
Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Ragavan, Nimble Pilferer.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 3
Stack.Count = 0
